  "details": "I've been playing on VRChat mobile during week 1 of the Alpha Test when lag and poor mic quality were very noticeable.  During this time, I and other users were able to use the very poor avatars on mobile, while others were shown in Fallback when in very poor avatars which was a compromise at the time.  Now that vrchat mobile is more stable, I want to see an option available for those who want to use, wear, and see their very poor avatar. The preview shows the avatar, and with a prompt and disclaimer or warning available, the user takes responsibility  for their action. This can be used to test avatars  on the Android side for those who don't have access to a standalone vr android based headset. The fallback imposters weren't even a suitable substitute when it was available in my opinion.",
